Neobrix greeter recovery
========================

Only needed if the login screen fails to appear after a boot. From a TTY
(Ctrl+Alt+F2) or the hypervisor console:

    sudo cp /etc/greetd/config.toml.pre-regreet /etc/greetd/config.toml
    sudo systemctl restart greetd

That restores CachyOS's noctalia-greeter-session, which is still installed.

To put the Neobrix greeter back afterwards:

    sudo cp /etc/greetd/config.toml.neobrix-greeter /etc/greetd/config.toml
    sudo systemctl restart greetd
